sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant U as Browser user
    participant T as Timeline.tsx
    participant API as FastAPI timeline.py
    participant TS as TraceStore
    participant DB as SQLite (timetravel.db)

    Note over U,DB: Phase 5 branch creation: fork modal → POST /branches → new row in branches table.

    Note over U,DB: Stage 1 user picks a parent and opens the fork modal
    U->>T: switch to branches mode
    T->>API: GET /api/v1/traces/{trace_id}/branches
    API->>TS: branch_tree(trace_id)
    TS->>DB: SELECT span-tree CTE + branches rows
    DB-->>TS: rows
    TS-->>API: BranchNode(root, children=...)
    API-->>T: 200 BranchNodeView JSON
    T-->>U: render BranchTree with 1 ← and 1 → button per row

    U->>T: click on row's fork ⎇ button
    T-->>U: open ForkBranchModal (label default "fork of X @ N")

    Note over U,DB: Stage 2 user submits modal POSTs new branch
    U->>T: edit label · click fork
    T->>API: POST /api/v1/traces/{trace_id}/branches<br/>{parent_branch_id, branch_at_index, mode: "manual", label}
    API->>API: pydantic v2 validate CreateBranchRequest
    API->>TS: fork_branch(trace_id, parent_branch_id, branch_at_index, mode, label)
    TS->>DB: BEGIN IMMEDIATE
    TS->>DB: SELECT 1 FROM branches WHERE branch_id = parent
    alt parent missing
        DB-->>TS: 0 rows
        TS-->>API: raises ValueError parent not found
        API-->>T: 409 conflict with detail
        T-->>U: error banner in modal
    else parent present
        DB-->>TS: 1 row
        TS->>DB: INSERT INTO branches (branch_id, trace_id, parent_branch_id, ...) VALUES (uuid4, ...)
        DB-->>TS: ok
        TS->>DB: COMMIT
        TS-->>API: CreateBranchResponse(branch_id, ...)
        API-->>T: 200 JSON
    end

    Note over U,DB: Stage 3 UI bumps revision and remounts BranchTree to refresh state
    T->>T: branchRevision++ (forces key change → remount)
    T->>API: GET /api/v1/traces/{trace_id}/branches (re-fetch)
    API-->>T: updated tree including new node
    T-->>U: modal closes · new branch visible in tree
